00:00:41.415 --> 00:00:44.280
We're not supposed to listen to music.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.510
They say it's a dark temptation.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:49.940
But I don't understand that.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.790
It's a beautiful way to show Leanne

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:56.900
